  <div class="abstract">
    <p data-label="Summary">The Astrometry block finds where the stack points on the sky. A first solution comes from
    Asterion, shipped with the installer; without it, or when it finds nothing, FLOAT’s own search takes over, blind
    when the target is unknown. The solution is then refined on the Gaia DR3 stars with a tangent-plane projection and a
    distortion polynomial. Colour calibration, the Gaia catalogues and the H-alpha reference read this solution. A run
    downloads nothing: the star catalogue is installed once.</p>
  </div>

  <ol class="chain" aria-label="Position in the graph">
    <li><span>Selection</span></li><li><span>Stacking</span></li>
